### Login primary user
### Expected: 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "linoy@example.com",
  "password": "{{testPassword}}"
}

### Login secondary user
### Expected: 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "maya@example.com",
  "password": "{{testPassword}}"
}

### Login with wrong password
### Expected: 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

