### IMPORTANT:
### Use a dedicated test user. Do not run these requests with a main account.

@deletedUserEmail = softdelete-test@example.com
@deletedUserUsername = Soft Delete Test
@deletedUserPassword = YOUR_TEST_PASSWORD
@deletedUserToken = YOUR_DELETED_USER_ACCESS_TOKEN
@deletedUserId = YOUR_DELETED_USER_ID
@activeUserToken = YOUR_ACTIVE_USER_ACCESS_TOKEN
@deletedUserCommentId = COMMENT_CREATED_BY_DELETED_USER
@deletedUserClubId = CLUB_CREATED_BY_DELETED_USER
@otherUserClubId = CLUB_CREATED_BY_ANOTHER_USER

### Register dedicated soft-delete user
### Expected: 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{deletedUserUsername}}",
  "email": "{{deletedUserEmail}}",
  "password": "{{deletedUserPassword}}",
  "favoriteGenres": ["Fantasy"],
  "favoriteBooks": ["The Hobbit"]
